id: blueprint-agility
name: Genetic Agility
order: 3
optionOf: combat-blueprint
optionEffect: 2
# Artificial Warrior's Option chosen: this one.
follows: genetic-agility
description: >
  If you spend 2+ Adaptation Points on the Dodge Roll of an Attacking Maneuver, you may ignore all Diminishing Defense you are suffering from for the duration of that Maneuver.
text: >
  Genetic Agility [Triggered, 1/Round]: If you spend 2+ Adaptation Points on the Dodge Roll of an Attacking Maneuver, you may ignore all Diminishing Defense you are suffering from for the duration of that Maneuver.

---

# Asked on a Dodge Roll with 2+ Adaptation Points spent on it - its Diminishing Defense rows taken off, once a Round (chat.mjs
# rollSide).
[passive]
allow blueprint.agility;
